# Kitesail Larcenist {2}{U}: "When this creature enters, for each player, choose up to one other target artifact or creature that
# player controls. For as long as this creature remains on the battlefield, the chosen permanents become Treasure artifacts ... and lose
# all other abilities" (CR 611.2a, 613.1d, 613.1f). Bot1 chooses its own Ornithopter (an artifact creature, 0/2 with flying) and Bot2's
# Llanowar Elves: each becomes an artifact, not a creature (CR 205.3d), a Treasure and nothing else - the Ornithopter's Flying and the
# Elves' mana ability go. The Larcenist itself is no legal choice and neither is an object of the wrong player in a slot, both refused.

